{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>About This Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mechanic VS AI is a 2D top-down tower defense game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Influenced by classic tower defense and flash games,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> it is filled with unique worlds, figure of enemies and exciting music!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Play as a very intelligent mechanic!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Maybe You will move forward with a great mission...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And get 30 different turrets from the stages of 5 worlds!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Many gimmicks and enemies are also waiting for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Finally, get rid of the bosses who are looking for a chance to attack you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>(Uh... Additionally, stage scores are meaningless.....)</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3617900?t=1744497289","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3617900?t=1744497289","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617900/f55ff23cffe3363a0935c7d99d466a393bc839bc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744497289","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617900/f55ff23cffe3363a0935c7d99d466a393bc839bc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744497289","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>About This Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mechanic VS AI is a 2D top-down tower defense game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Influenced by classic tower defense and flash games,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> it is filled with unique worlds, figure of enemies and exciting music!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Play as a very intelligent mechanic!</str